ACP spike: minimal client (Node, no global deps) that drives codex through the @agentclientprotocol/codex-acp adapter.
Install (local, no -g):  cd Centaury-Client/spikes/acp-codex && npm install
Run:                     node spike.mjs ["prompt"]   # default "Reply only: hello"; uses the ~/.codex login
Defaults: CODEX_PATH=~/.local/bin/codex and read-only mode; ACP_AGENT=/path/to/acp-agent for another agent. Stderr: /tmp/centaury-demo/acp-codex-stderr.log
Context and results: ../../ACP.md
